# Local review before ship

For Chinaready Landscape page or content changes (landscape.yml, guide.yml, alternatives/SEO pages, assets that affect the site):

1. Make the change and run `npm run build` (and `npm run verify` when relevant).
2. Start or point the user at local preview (`npm run serve` → typically http://127.0.0.1:8000) and ask them to review.
3. **Do not** commit, push to main, or deploy until the user explicitly confirms the local review looks good and asks to ship.

This overrides any “ship without asking” preference for this repo when the change affects pages users can review in the browser.
